  // Mossdeep City's Gym (plan 21 · H8, part a): Tate and Liza's hall of floor islands joined by warp pads, where loops
  // of coloured arrows carry the trainers and the stone statues standing on them round a step whenever a switch of their
  // colour is stepped on (world.json's puzzle, MossdeepTiles; the triggers below say `rotatetiles`). The statues are
  // things of the map (GymStatue), drawn as cards. Twelve trainers stand between the door and the twins
  // (mossdeep_city_gym.txt), and the pad beside the twins sends the player back to the door
  "area": "mossdeep_city_gym",
